			"notes": "# 1.4.0-alpha\n## THIS IS A BREAKING UPDATE, BACKUP YOUR WORLDS BEFORE UPDATING\n- Updated to Minecraft 26.3\n- Chisels can now be enchanted with Silk Touch and Fortune\n- Added new Item drops when chiseling:\n  - All 3x3 ingot/gem blocks drop their respective ingot/gem\n  - All Raw Ore blocks drop their respective raw ore\n  - Bamboo blocks now drop Bamboo\n  - Crafting Tables and Poplar Log varients now drop Sticks\n  - Nether Wart blocks now drop nether wart\n  - Prismarine bricks and dark prismarine now drop Prismarine Shards\n  - Melons now drop Melon Slices\n  - Hay Bales now drop Wheat\n  - Resin Blocks now drop Resin Clumps\n  - Blue Ice now drops Packed Ice when using a Silk Touch chisel\n  - Packed Ice now drops Ice when using a Silk Touch Chisel\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MyNamesRaph/Chiseled/compare/1.3.0-alpha...1.4.0-alpha"
		},
